title: The Dreamland
subtitle: Are you okay, Tovarishch Martov?
set-bg: img/dreams.png
face-image: img/martovgrave.jpg
view-if: difficulty = surreal and devmode = 1
new-page: true

= You feel strange.

*Tovarishch? Martov? Can you hear me?*

- @relations: Party and International Relations.
- @money: Party Resources, Government Budget, and Economic Plans.
- @support: Party Support.
- @paramilitary: Paramilitary and Government Troops.
- @root: Open your eyes, Tovarishch. Return to reality.

@relations

- @commies: The Communists of the RKP?
- @leftnarod: The Narodists of the PLSR?
- @farmernarod: The Neo-Narodists of the PSR?
- @libtards: The Liberals of the K-D?
- @conservatives: The Conservatives and Monarchists of the VS?
- @solidarists: The Solidarists?
- @return

@solidarists
title: NTS-RSDRP Relations
choose-if: ideology = "partydeath"
unavailable-subtitle: **They** cannot hear you.

@conservatives
title: VS-RSDRP Relations
choose-if: ideology = "partydeath"
unavailable-subtitle: **They** cannot hear you.

@commies
title: RKP-RSDRP Relations
subtitle: You wish to warp your old Comrades?

**The strings of reality lay before you...*..*

- @maxrelationsrkp: They will be your Comrades once more.
- @increaserelationsrkp: They will think better of you.
- @lowerrelationsrkp: They will think worse of you.
- @tankrelationsrkp: They will be your sworn enemies once more.
- @return

@maxrelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation += 100

What else lies beyond the veil?

@increaserelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation += 25

What else lies beyond the veil?

@lowerrelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation -= 25

What else lies beyond the veil?

@tankrelationsrkp
on-arrival: rkp_relation -= 100

What else lies beyond the veil?

