@money

*The strings of reality lay before you...*

- @partycash
- @govcash
- @planning
- @return

@partycash
title: Party Resources
subtitle: Greed is a sin, Tovarishch, remember that. +999 Resources.
on-arrival: resources += 999

What else lies beyond the veil?

@govcash
title: Government Budget
subtitle: Greed is a sin, Tovarishch, remember that. +999 Budget.
on-arrival: budget += 999

What else lies beyond the veil?

@planning
title: Economic Plans
subtitle: Every crisis has a solution.

*The strings of reality lay before you...*

- @leftplan
- @reformistplan
- @laborplan
- @return

@leftplan
title: Socialization is your goal?
subtitle: Adopt the Left Plan.
on-arrival: nationalization_adopted = 1;

What else lies beyond the veil?

@reformistplan
title: Moderation is your goal?
subtitle: Adopt the Reformist Plan.
on-arrival: moderate_plan_adopted = 1;

What else lies beyond the veil?

@laborplan
